Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:41.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:42.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,退開
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:41.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.43,0:03:41.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:43.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,受傷了沒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:45.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:54.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,剛剛那兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:56.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,難道是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,總之
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:03:59.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南風把她們引開了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一時半會兒回不來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:03.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天色不早了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:04.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們得加快速度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:07.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.29,0:04:09.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你可知那善月草
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:10.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,長在城中何處
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:13.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:15.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只知道古城的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:20.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,據說善月草葉大根細
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:22.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,矮小喜陰 形似尖桃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.93,0:04:24.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多生長於高大建築旁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:26.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,高大建築
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:36.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,畢竟在傳說里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:38.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是王后摘取了善月草
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.94,0:04:40.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:41.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,傳說半月國主
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:45.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殺害了兩隻無辜的毒物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:46.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,毒物心懷怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:49.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蠍尾蛇便是它們的後代
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:53.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可這 和善月草有什麼關係呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:55.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那兩隻毒物死後
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:57.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,王后摘了一片善月草葉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:04:58.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蓋住它們的屍體以示仁慈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,從此這種葉子就可以解蠍尾蛇毒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:05.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:08.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,善月草 長在皇宮裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:11.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走吧 去皇宮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,時間不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:26.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們分頭找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:27.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.55,0:05:45.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:05:59.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道長哥哥 別打
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:01.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:02.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怎麼在這
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:04.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你當真是天生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:06.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我 真是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:08.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還有幾個叔叔也跟著來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:10.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們就在裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:11.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不信你看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:13.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:15.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:17.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:18.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我在這呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:19.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:22.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們怎麼在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知你們何時回來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:27.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們還是想辦法跟過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們膽子也太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:30.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明知危險還敢跟來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:33.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,幸好你們沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:34.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們怎麼知道善月草在皇宮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:40.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們想著好東西肯定都藏在皇宮裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:41.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以就
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:43.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:46.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,應該就是它了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:54.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這藥有用嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:08.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,感覺好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:11.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這麼神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:13.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.05,0:07:13.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 三郎\N- 快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:13.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:13.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 大家再找找\N- 三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:13.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家再找找
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:14.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 多謝你了\N- 大家再找找
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:14.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:15.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:17.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我去那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我去那頭看看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我這也找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:33.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:36.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭 你哪兒找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走走走 我們也去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:40.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多摘些還能賣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那裡的草 你別用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:48.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:50.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.43,0:07:52.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是不是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:54.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 我沒有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:56.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走開 你踩到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:18.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:20.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家別慌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:22.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一張人面而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:24.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰還沒一張臉了不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:28.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嚇到你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.09,0:08:31.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,唉 我也經常嚇到我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:32.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:34.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們又是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:36.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,過路的商隊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:40.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,五六十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:43.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也曾是過路的商隊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:45.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那 那您老人家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.31,0:08:46.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為何會在這啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:51.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,當初半月士兵抓了我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:52.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,埋在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:55.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把我當成善月草的肥料
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:08:59.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你用的那片沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:01.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎有心了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:04.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我好多年都沒見過活人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:06.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們 你們都站過來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:09.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,讓我好好看看 行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:09.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:10.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:11.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不願意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:14.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:18.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我有件疑惑的事 想親自確認
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:19.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:25.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們中有一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:29.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我五六十年前就見過了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:31.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你說的這個人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:32.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:33.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靠近點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:35.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:36.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家都退開
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:37.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別信他的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你真的不想知道那人是誰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:43.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他會害死你們所有人的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:46.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這又是何必
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也是個人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不會害你們的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:53.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別撿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:53.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,回來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:04.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:06.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吃 好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:08.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:11.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吃 餓死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:12.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,餓死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:14.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:42.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們在這兒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:46.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是 是半月士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:10:58.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先押走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:03.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別慌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:05.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們只是要把我們帶去別處
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,暫時不會殺人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:08.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家不要輕舉妄動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:09.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,見機行事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:11.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,將軍 將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:13.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我幫你把敵人留下了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你放我回家去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:26.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:36.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:38.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:40.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這是你的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:43.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你的血肉早就化為善月草的養分了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這 這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.29,0:11:47.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:48.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我的身體不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:49.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.41,0:11:52.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你現在看不慣這副身體了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:54.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那方才你嘴裡伸出了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:56.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什麼問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:12:00.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只 只不過比普通人的舌頭長點罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:01.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:02.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是長了一點點
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:05.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你還覺得自己是個人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:07.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我當然是個人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:08.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,當然是人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:11.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也有人舌頭長的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:12.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:15.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只稍微長了一點
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:17.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是為了吃飛蟲活命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:18.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,慢慢伸長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:19.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才變成這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.61,0:12:22.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:24.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中原人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:25.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,活該
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:30.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我可以回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:36.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:43.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們稱這領頭的半月人為將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知是什麼將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:47.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月國滅亡時
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只有一位將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.81,0:12:51.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他的名字翻譯成漢文
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:52.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,叫刻磨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:53.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刻磨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:55.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,據說他幼時體弱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:56.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,時常受人欺辱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:12:58.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他發誓變強
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:12:59.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以石刻磨盤鍛煉力氣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:01.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便得了這麼個名字
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:04.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其實也可以叫大力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:07.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他確實力大無窮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:10.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是半月國歷代最勇猛的大將
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也是半月國師忠實的擁護者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:14.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,死後也是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在他是要送我們到半月國師那裡去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:21.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,或許吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:29.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:31.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這裡是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:33.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,罪人坑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:45.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:35.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,弟兄們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:42.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只丟兩個下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.63,0:14:44.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其他人帶走看好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:46.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:48.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什麼事我會先上的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:58.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:12.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:25.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,救命 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:26.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別抓我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:30.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:30.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,且慢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:33.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:35.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你會說我們的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:36.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是哪裡人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:38.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我從中原之地來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:39.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中原
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:41.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永安後人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:42.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.06,0:15:43.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永安國早已被滅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.98,0:15:44.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:46.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在已經沒有永安人了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:47.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:50.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中原人都是永安的後人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:51.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我們的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:52.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,卑鄙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:54.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,騙子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:55.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把他扔下去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:58.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月國已消失兩百餘年了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:00.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你並非我們的國人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,卻會我們的語言
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你到底是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:12.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,救命 救命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:12.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 將軍\N- 救命 救命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:12.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:14.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我先來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:14.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:14.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 你先來\N- 放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:15.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你先來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:16.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:17.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這些都是無辜的過路商人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:20.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 何況裡面還有孩子\N- 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:20.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,何況裡面還有孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:21.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:22.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們永安軍隊血洗我國時
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:23.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 放開\N- 你們永安軍隊血洗我國時
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:24.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們永安軍隊血洗我國時
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:27.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可沒想過這裡也有很多無辜的商人和孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:30.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你很可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:30.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 放開\N- 你很可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:30.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:31.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 不能下去\N- 放開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:31.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不能下去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:32.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要問你話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:34.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,丟別的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.53,0:16:36.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:37.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還是我先跳為敬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:43.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三 三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:53.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:55.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等 三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:55.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你先別動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:56.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:02.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:04.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:05.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我先離開一會兒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:36.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
